## 3. Main slide

TIME 1:05. A name and target trait first define the scope. The host agent then researches six views of the person. Writings reveal recurring arguments, interviews reveal reasoning under pressure, and short-form expression reveals voice. Criticism provides counterexamples, decisions test statements against actions, and the timeline records change. Each stream saves research with source and confidence, distinguishing direct statements, outside reports and inference. Nuwa prefers primary material, including supplied local sources, and retains unresolved contradictions. If the user provides a strong corpus, it searches only for missing dimensions. Its later quality targets include more than half primary sources, specific model limits, honest boundaries and tensions. Finally, it checks known positions, an unfamiliar question and recognizable voice. AI4R can learn to collect evidence that challenges a candidate rule and retain its provenance, rather than generate a polished method from a few quotations. These are prescribed criteria, not proof that every example meets them.

SOURCES
