## 9. Main slide

TIME 0:30. Nuwa shows how documented human reasoning can become a reusable skill. For AI4Research, we should learn the evidence-to-procedure method: preserve sources and disagreement, extract usable rules, and derive concrete investigation steps. A Nuwa-like authoring pipeline could become a reasoning-skill branch of the CC factory. We should improve its assurance with explicit source checks, independent unseen tasks and bounded cost. The next decision is whether one such reviewer improves real AI4R work beyond an equally informed agent. That experiment earns further integration; resemblance to a person does not.

